--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT WAS BUILT (full panel/chart/state/string parity — no scope narrowing)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Native SwiftUI page bound to an @Observable WeeklyDigestPageModel over an injected
WeeklyDigestPageSource seam (P1/S8 pattern, mirroring WeeklyDigestWidget). Reproduces
EVERY region of the web source in the same data + order:
  WeekSelector → SummaryHeroCards (incl. Fun Fact) → DrivingSection (daily-distance
  bar chart + 4 mini-stats + Top Drive) → ChargingSection (daily-energy bar chart +
  4 mini-stats + energy-vs-last-week) → BatteryHealthSection (2 battery pills + 3
  stats) → AlertsSection (severity list + distribution donut / all-clear empty) →
  WeekOverWeekSummary (6 comparison cards).
Charts use the P3 Swift Charts wrappers (TSBarChart / TSPieChart in TSChartContainer)
— never WKWebView, never a direct Charts import in feature code. Units/figures are a
1:1 port of useWeeklyDigest + helpers.ts + constants.ts (Monday-first week ranges,
day-of-week bins, trend/percent incl. inverted metrics, fun-fact city pairing, the
locale number/currency formatting).

Files (14, all <= 265 lines; per feature-views multi-file convention):
  WeeklyDigestPage.swift              — page scaffold: subtitle, toolbar vehicle picker,
                                        loading/empty/error/content switch
  WeeklyDigestPage.Model.swift        — @Observable model + Source seam + InMemory source
  WeeklyDigestPage.Inputs.swift       — Drive/Charge/Alert DTOs, formatting, trend, constants
  WeeklyDigestPage.Projection.swift   — projected piece structs + WeeklyDigestProjection
  WeeklyDigestPage.Projector.swift    — project() + aggregate() + daily bins
  WeeklyDigestPage.Cards.swift        — hero / driving / charging section builders
  WeeklyDigestPage.Stats.swift        — battery / alerts / week-over-week builders
  WeeklyDigestPage.Math.swift         — week range / trend / number-format helpers
  WeeklyDigestPage.Localization.swift — catalog facade + adaptive grid columns
  WeeklyDigestPage.Components.swift   — leaf views (trend, hero card, mini-stat, pill, bar chart)
  WeeklyDigestPage.Sections.swift     — 7 section views + DigestSkeleton
  WeeklyDigestPage.Alerts.swift       — AlertsSection (severity list + donut)
  WeeklyDigestPage.Navigation.swift   — .analytics route registration (cached model)
  WeeklyDigestPage.Previews.swift     — content/empty/loading/error previews

Navigation: AnalyticsRouteRegistration hosts the page at the .analytics route via the
shell AppRouteHostRegistry; wired in Sources/TeslaSyncApp.swift; /weekly-digest deep
link aliased to .analytics in Sources/App/AppRouteParser.swift. Production KMP-backed
source is injected at the macOS build (same deferral as AppContainer.bootstrap); the
default unconnected source renders the genuine "No Data" state — never fabricated data
(ADR-011).

Strings: 5 required keys resolve from apps/apple/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings
(translation.analytics.weeklyDigest.*). 3 missing catalog keys added (noDataMessage,
funFactDesc, noAlerts); JSON re-validated.

Build wiring: TeslaSync/Features/Analytics added to both app targets in
apps/apple/project.yml and to apps/apple/.swiftlint.yml `included`.

